SO[Checked against the OGS Joseki Explorer and the resigning-in-sente 3-3 invasion series, 2026-11-24. Explanations are our own.]
C[Black has the 4-4 point in the upper-right corner. White invades at the 3-3 point. Three lines: the knight's move (main line), the double hane, and the push.]

;B[pd]JS[joseki]JT[main-line]
