;W[qc]JS[joseki]JT[main-line]
C[White invades at the 3-3 point. There is just enough room in the corner for White to live.]

;B[qd]JS[joseki]JT[main-line,block-direction]
C[Black blocks on the side where they want to build, here the right side. Now White can only grow along the top.]

;W[pc]JS[joseki]JT[main-line]
C[White crawls along the top to get room for eyes.]

(;B[od]JS[joseki]JT[main-line]
C[Black extends. This is the simplest choice: Black lets White live small and keeps a strong wall.]

(;W[nb]JS[joseki]JT[main-line]
