JL[33-knight]JN[3-3 invasion: knight's move]
JR[White gets a small, safe corner. Black gets a strong wall facing the right side, and sente: Black may play anywhere next.])

(;W[oc]JS[joseki]JT[variation]
C[Instead of sliding, White pushes into Black's wall to get a little more room on top.]

;B[nc]JS[joseki]JT[variation]
C[Black hanes at the head of White's stones and stops them from growing along the top.]

;W[nb]JS[joseki]JT[variation]
