(;B[oc]JS[joseki]JT[variation]
C[Black hanes instead, taking away White's room on top. This is how Black fights for the corner.]

;W[ob]JS[joseki]JT[variation]
C[White hanes underneath to keep some space along the edge.]

;B[nb]JS[joseki]JT[variation]
C[The double hane: Black hanes a second time to take the corner back.]

;W[nc]JS[joseki]JT[variation]
C[White cuts. Black's hane stone at P17 is now in atari: it has only one liberty left.]

;B[od]JS[joseki]JT[variation]
C[Black connects and saves the P17 stone.]

;W[mb]JS[joseki]JT[variation]
